- * association (0130); ready hook for ifnet / future IO80211. WPA2 later.
+ * association (0130); WPA2-PSK assoc + key install (0131); ready hook for
+ * ifnet / future IO80211. In-kernel 4-way still TODO (wifipsk= armed).
  */
